### 1 · Service dependency map — graph (panel below left)

Two queries. **A** is the edges, **B** the per-service error ratio that colours the nodes.

```promql
sum by (client, server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__rate_interval]))
```
`Format: Time series` · `Legend: {{client}}-->{{server}}` · `Type: Range`

```promql
  sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_failed_total[$__rate_interval]))
/ sum by (server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__rate_interval]))
```
`Format: Time series` · `Legend: {{server}}` · `Type: Range`

```json
[
  {
    "id": "joinByField",
    "filter": {
      "id": "byRefId",
      "options": "A"
    },
    "options": {
      "byField": "Time",
      "mode": "outer"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "joinByField",
    "filter": {
      "id": "byRefId",
      "options": "B"
    },
    "options": {
      "byField": "Time",
      "mode": "outer"
    }
  }
]
```

### 2 · Kubernetes CPU requests — sankey (panel below right)

Two queries, both edges, **one unfiltered join** — they belong in the same frame.

```promql
sum by (node, namespace) (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource="cpu"})
```
`Legend: {{node}}-->{{namespace}}`

```promql
sum by (namespace, workload) (
  namespace_workload_pod:kube_pod_owner:relabel
    * on (namespace, pod) group_left()
      sum by (namespace, pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_requests{resource="cpu"})
)
```
`Legend: {{namespace}}-->{{workload}}`

### 3 · Cross-AZ request matrix — chord

```promql
sum by (source_zone, destination_zone) (
  rate(istio_requests_total{reporter="destination"}[$__rate_interval])
)
```
`Legend: {{source_zone}}-->{{destination_zone}}`

### 4 · The table route — graph, instant + `label_join` + `rowsToFields`

```promql
label_join(
  sum by (client, server) (rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[$__range])),
  "id", ":", "client", "server"
)
```
`Format: Table` · `Type: Instant`

```json
[
  {
    "id": "organize",
    "options": {
      "excludeByName": {
        "Time": true
      },
      "indexByName": {
        "id": 0,
        "Value": 1,
        "client": 2,
        "server": 3
      },
      "renameByName": {
        "client": "source",
        "server": "target"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "rowsToFields",
    "options": {}
  }
]
```
